1. login as assessor
2. worker self-registration is idempotent
3. resolve the pinned QP code/version to a server pack_id
4. create the assessment (draft)
5. build and upload a real ECDSA-signed manifest (2 items: T1 photo, T2 video)
6. sync-status shows the manifest received, items still pending
7. upload T1 photo evidence, cross-checked against the verified manifest
8. a deliberately WRONG hash for T2 is rejected, local state would be retained (409)
9. submit is correctly blocked until every declared item is verified
10. now upload T2 with the CORRECT hash -- the manifest completes
