12. the assessment records the device's pinned public key's revision
13. assessor reviews: evidence is protected, playable, and scoreable
14. audit log records the sync-specific actions, with old/new score on rescoring
15b. score every T2 (CON/N0602) PC too, so reopening T2 below has real scores to flag needs_review on
15. audit log is protected -- a worker token cannot read it
16. assessor requests a targeted reassessment of T2 only, with a reason and capture instructions
17. T1 (not reopened) is locked; T2 (reopened) accepts a fresh upload session
18. v2 manifest re-declares T1 by reference (never re-uploaded) + a brand-new T2 item
