20. v1's T1 evidence and T1's original score remain exactly as they were (immutable)
21. re-review T2's reopened PC (the T1 PC scored earlier needs no re-review); sign off
22. public /verify/{report_id} confirms the v2 report; a tampered local copy fails offline verify
